  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali: Supporting the Government in the Revision of the National Migration Policy and the Development of a National Gender and Migration Action Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x200B;&#x200B;&#x200B;The objective of this project is to contribute to a strengthened institutional and policy framework on migration governance in Mali while mainstreaming a gender perspective. &#x200B;The project will seek to do so by supporting the Government of Mali to adopt a revised National Migration Policy (NMP) and putting in place robust mechanisms to support the production of evidence-based data (Outcome 1) by developing a draft revised NMP and its action plan, taking into account gender considerations (Output 1.1) and by equipping relevant stakeholders to produce disaggregated data to enable a gender-sensitive evaluation of the NMP based on migration governance indicators (Output 1.2). In addition, the project will support the Government of Mali to implement a National Gender and Migration Action Plan and improve coordination for the integration of migration and gender into local and sectoral policies (Outcome 2) by developing a National Gender and Migration Action Plan in consultation with the Women&apos;s Empowerment Dialogue Group and all other relevant stakeholders (Output 2.1) and by strengthening coordination between relevant stakeholders to integrate migration and gender issues into sectoral and local policies (Output 2.2).</narrative>
  </description>
